// Ø´ØºÙ‘Ù„ `npm run prisma:migrate:dev` Ø£ÙˆÙ„ Ù…Ø±Ø© Ù„Ø¥Ù†Ø´Ø§Ø¡ Ø§Ù„Ø¬Ø¯Ø§ÙˆÙ„.

generator client {
  provider = "prisma-client-js"
}

datasource db {
  provider = "postgresql"
  url      = env("DATABASE_URL")
}

model User {
  id             String   @id @default(uuid())
  username       String   @unique
  email          String?  @unique
  phone          String?  @unique
  passwordHash   String?
  displayName    String
  avatarUrl      String?
  coverUrl       String?
  bio            String   @default("")
  country        String?
  statusMessage  String?
  authProvider   String   @default("EMAIL") // EMAIL | PHONE | GOOGLE | APPLE | GUEST
  isVerified     Boolean  @default(false)
  isOnline       Boolean  @default(false)
  lastSeenAt     DateTime?
  createdAt      DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt      DateTime @updatedAt

  // ===== Ø­Ù‚ÙˆÙ„ Ù„ÙˆØ­Ø© Ø§Ù„ØªØ­ÙƒÙ… Ø§Ù„Ø¥Ø¯Ø§Ø±ÙŠØ© =====
  isBanned       Boolean   @default(false)
  bannedReason   String?
  bannedAt       DateTime?
  isDisabled     Boolean   @default(false) // ØªØ¹Ø·ÙŠÙ„ Ù…Ø¤Ù‚Øª (ÙŠØ³ØªØ·ÙŠØ¹ ØµØ§Ø­Ø¨ Ø§Ù„Ø­Ø³Ø§Ø¨ Ø·Ù„Ø¨ Ø¥Ø¹Ø§Ø¯Ø© Ø§Ù„ØªÙØ¹ÙŠÙ„ Ù„Ø§Ø­Ù‚Ù‹Ø§)

  refreshTokens       RefreshToken[]
  pushTokens          PushToken[]
  sentMessages        Message[]            @relation("MessageSender")
  ownedRooms          Room[]               @relation("RoomOwner")
  roomMemberships     RoomMember[]
  posts               Post[]
  comments            Comment[]
  postLikes           PostLike[]
  conversationMembers ConversationParticipant[]
  followedBy          Follow[]             @relation("Following")
  following           Follow[]             @relation("Followers")
  notifications       Notification[]       @relation("NotificationTarget")
  verificationRequests VerificationRequest[]
  reportsFiled        Report[]             @relation("ReportedBy")
  mediaAssets         MediaAsset[]
  activityEvents      ActivityEvent[]

  @@index([username])
  @@index([isBanned])
  @@index([createdAt])
}

model Follow {
  id          String   @id @default(uuid())
  followerId  String
  followingId String
  createdAt   DateTime @default(now())

  follower  User @relation("Followers", fields: [followerId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  following User @relation("Following", fields: [followingId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@unique([followerId, followingId])
}

model RefreshToken {
  id        String   @id @default(uuid())
  token     String   @unique
  userId    String
  expiresAt DateTime
  revoked   Boolean  @default(false)
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
  deviceInfo String?

  user User @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@index([userId])
}

model PushToken {
  id         String   @id @default(uuid())
  userId     String
  token      String   @unique
  platform   String   @default("android")
  appVersion String?  // Ù„Ø¯Ø¹Ù… Ø§Ø³ØªÙ‡Ø¯Ø§Ù Ø§Ù„Ø¥Ø´Ø¹Ø§Ø±Ø§Øª Ø­Ø³Ø¨ Ø¥ØµØ¯Ø§Ø± Ø§Ù„ØªØ·Ø¨ÙŠÙ‚ Ù…Ù† Ù„ÙˆØ­Ø© Ø§Ù„ØªØ­ÙƒÙ…
  locale     String?  // Ù„Ø¯Ø¹Ù… Ø§Ù„Ø§Ø³ØªÙ‡Ø¯Ø§Ù Ø­Ø³Ø¨ Ø§Ù„Ù„ØºØ©
  createdAt  DateTime @default(now())

  user User @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
}

model Conversation {
  id            String   @id @default(uuid())
  type          String   // PRIVATE | GROUP
  title         String?
  avatarUrl     String?
  createdAt     DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt     DateTime @updatedAt

  participants  ConversationParticipant[]
  messages      Message[]
}

model ConversationParticipant {
  id             String   @id @default(uuid())
  conversationId String
  userId         String
  unreadCount    Int      @default(0)
  isMuted        Boolean  @default(false)
  isPinned       Boolean  @default(false)
  lastReadAt     DateTime?
  joinedAt       DateTime @default(now())

  conversation Conversation @relation(fields: [conversationId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  user         User         @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@unique([conversationId, userId])
  @@index([userId])
}

model Message {
  id                    String   @id @default(uuid())
  conversationId        String
  senderId              String
  type                  String   // TEXT | IMAGE | VIDEO | VOICE | FILE | GIF | STICKER | LOCATION | SYSTEM
  text                  String?
  mediaJson             String?  // JSON Ù…ÙØ³Ù„Ø³Ù„ Ù„Ø¹Ù†Ø§ØµØ± MediaItem (Ø±ÙˆØ§Ø¨Ø· Cloudinary ÙÙ‚Ø·)
  replyToMessageId      String?
  forwardedFromUserId   String?
  reactionsJson         String?  // JSON: { "ðŸ‘": ["userId1","userId2"] }
  status                String   @default("SENT")
  isEdited              Boolean  @default(false)
  isDeletedForEveryone  Boolean  @default(false)
  isPinned              Boolean  @default(false)
  createdAt             DateTime @default(now())
  editedAt              DateTime?

  conversation Conversation @relation(fields: [conversationId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  sender       User         @relation("MessageSender", fields: [senderId], references: [id])

  @@index([conversationId, createdAt])
}

model Room {
  id           String   @id @default(uuid())
  name         String
  description  String   @default("")
  iconUrl      String?
  bannerUrl    String?
  visibility   String   @default("PUBLIC") // PUBLIC | PRIVATE
  ownerId      String
  parentRoomId String?
  rulesJson    String?  // JSON: ["rule1","rule2"]
  createdAt    DateTime @default(now())

  owner   User         @relation("RoomOwner", fields: [ownerId], references: [id])
  members RoomMember[]

  @@index([visibility])
}

model RoomMember {
  id       String   @id @default(uuid())
  roomId   String
  userId   String
  role     String   @default("MEMBER") // OWNER | ADMIN | MODERATOR | MEMBER
  isMuted  Boolean  @default(false)
  joinedAt DateTime @default(now())

  room Room @relation(fields: [roomId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  user User @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@unique([roomId, userId])
}

model Post {
  id             String   @id @default(uuid())
  authorId       String
  text           String?
  mediaJson      String?  // JSON Ù„Ø¹Ù†Ø§ØµØ± MediaItem
  pollJson       String?  // JSON Ù„Ø¨ÙŠØ§Ù†Ø§Øª Ø§Ù„Ø§Ø³ØªØ·Ù„Ø§Ø¹ ÙˆØ§Ù„Ø£ØµÙˆØ§Øª
  hashtagsJson   String?  // JSON: ["tag1","tag2"]
  isRepost       Boolean  @default(false)
  originalPostId String?
  likesCount     Int      @default(0)
  commentsCount  Int      @default(0)
  repostsCount   Int      @default(0)
  sharesCount    Int      @default(0)
  createdAt      DateTime @default(now())

  author   User       @relation(fields: [authorId], references: [id])
  likes    PostLike[]
  comments Comment[]

  @@index([createdAt])
}

model PostLike {
  id     String @id @default(uuid())
  postId String
  userId String

  post Post @relation(fields: [postId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  user User @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@unique([postId, userId])
}

model Comment {
  id        String   @id @default(uuid())
  postId    String
  authorId  String
  text      String
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())

  post   Post @relation(fields: [postId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  author User @relation(fields: [authorId], references: [id])
}

model Notification {
  id          String   @id @default(uuid())
  targetId    String   // userId Ø§Ù„Ù…Ø³ØªÙ‚Ø¨ÙÙ„
  type        String   // MESSAGE | LIKE | COMMENT | FOLLOW | MENTION | ROOM_INVITE | SYSTEM
  actorUserId String
  relatedId   String?
  message     String
  isRead      Boolean  @default(false)
  createdAt   DateTime @default(now())

  target User @relation("NotificationTarget", fields: [targetId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@index([targetId, createdAt])
}

// ======================================================================
// Ù†Ù…Ø§Ø°Ø¬ Ù„ÙˆØ­Ø© ØªØ­ÙƒÙ… Ø§Ù„Ø¥Ø¯Ø§Ø±Ø© (Admin Dashboard) â€” Ù…Ù†ÙØµÙ„Ø© ØªÙ…Ø§Ù…Ù‹Ø§ Ø¹Ù† Ø­Ø³Ø§Ø¨Ø§Øª
// Ø§Ù„Ù…Ø³ØªØ®Ø¯Ù…ÙŠÙ† Ø§Ù„Ø¹Ø§Ø¯ÙŠÙŠÙ† (AdminUser Ù…Ø³ØªÙ‚Ù„ Ø¹Ù† UserØŒ Ø¨Ø¬Ø¯ÙˆÙ„ Ø¬Ù„Ø³Ø§Øª ÙˆÙ…ØµØ§Ø¯Ù‚Ø© Ø®Ø§ØµØ©).
// ======================================================================

model AdminUser {
  id                String   @id @default(uuid())
  email             String   @unique
  passwordHash      String
  displayName       String
  role              String   @default("SUPPORT") // SUPER_ADMIN | ADMIN | MODERATOR | SUPPORT
  isActive          Boolean  @default(true)
  twoFactorSecret   String?
  twoFactorEnabled  Boolean  @default(false)
  lastLoginAt       DateTime?
  createdAt         DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt         DateTime @updatedAt

  auditLogs         AuditLog[]
  reviewedVerifications VerificationRequest[] @relation("VerificationReviewer")
  resolvedReports   Report[]                  @relation("ReportResolver")
  refreshTokens     AdminRefreshToken[]

  @@index([role])
}

model AdminRefreshToken {
  id         String   @id @default(uuid())
  token      String   @unique
  adminId    String
  expiresAt  DateTime
  revoked    Boolean  @default(false)
  deviceInfo String?
  createdAt  DateTime @default(now())

  admin AdminUser @relation(fields: [adminId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@index([adminId])
}

model AuditLog {
  id         String   @id @default(uuid())
  adminId    String
  action     String   // Ù…Ø«Ø§Ù„: "USER_BANNED", "POST_DELETED", "VERIFICATION_APPROVED"
  targetType String   // USER | POST | ROOM | MESSAGE | VERIFICATION | NOTIFICATION | REPORT
  targetId   String?
  metadataJson String? // ØªÙØ§ØµÙŠÙ„ Ø¥Ø¶Ø§ÙÙŠØ© (Ø³Ø¨Ø¨ØŒ Ù‚ÙŠÙ… Ù‚Ø¨Ù„/Ø¨Ø¹Ø¯...) ÙƒÙ€ JSON Ù†ØµÙŠ
  createdAt  DateTime @default(now())

  admin AdminUser @relation(fields: [adminId], references: [id])

  @@index([adminId, createdAt])
  @@index([targetType, targetId])
}

model Report {
  id          String   @id @default(uuid())
  reporterId  String
  targetType  String   // USER | POST | ROOM | MESSAGE | COMMENT
  targetId    String
  reason      String
  details     String?
  status      String   @default("PENDING") // PENDING | REVIEWED | DISMISSED | ACTION_TAKEN
  resolvedById String?
  resolvedAt  DateTime?
  resolutionNote String?
  createdAt   DateTime @default(now())

  reporter   User       @relation("ReportedBy", fields: [reporterId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  resolvedBy AdminUser? @relation("ReportResolver", fields: [resolvedById], references: [id])

  @@index([status, createdAt])
  @@index([targetType, targetId])
}

model VerificationRequest {
  id          String   @id @default(uuid())
  userId      String
  type        String   @default("IDENTITY") // IDENTITY | BUSINESS | PUBLIC_FIGURE | CREATOR (Ù‚Ø§Ø¨Ù„Ø© Ù„Ù„ØªÙˆØ³Ø¹Ø© Ù…Ø³ØªÙ‚Ø¨Ù„Ù‹Ø§)
  reason      String?  // Ø³Ø¨Ø¨/Ø±Ø³Ø§Ù„Ø© Ù…Ù‚Ø¯Ù‘Ù… Ø§Ù„Ø·Ù„Ø¨
  documentUrl String?  // Ø±Ø§Ø¨Ø· Cloudinary Ù„Ù…Ø³ØªÙ†Ø¯ Ø¥Ø«Ø¨Ø§Øª (Ø§Ø®ØªÙŠØ§Ø±ÙŠ)
  status      String   @default("PENDING") // PENDING | APPROVED | REJECTED
  rejectionReason String?
  reviewedById String?
  reviewedAt  DateTime?
  createdAt   DateTime @default(now())

  user       User       @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  reviewedBy AdminUser? @relation("VerificationReviewer", fields: [reviewedById], references: [id])

  @@index([status, createdAt])
}

model MediaAsset {
  id         String   @id @default(uuid())
  uploadedById String
  type       String   // IMAGE | VIDEO | AUDIO | FILE | GIF
  url        String
  bytes      Int?
  createdAt  DateTime @default(now())

  uploadedBy User @relation(fields: [uploadedById], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@index([createdAt])
  @@index([type])
}

// حدث نشاط يومي مبسط لكل مستخدم — يستخدم لحساب DAU/WAU/MAU بدقة معقولة.
model ActivityEvent {
  id     String   @id @default(uuid())
  userId String
  day    DateTime // ÙŠÙØ®Ø²ÙŽÙ‘Ù† Ø¨Ù…Ù†ØªØµÙ Ù„ÙŠÙ„ Ø§Ù„ÙŠÙˆÙ… (00:00 UTC) Ù„ØªØ³Ù‡ÙŠÙ„ Ø§Ù„ØªØ¬Ù…ÙŠØ¹

  user User @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@unique([userId, day])
  @@index([day])
}

model BroadcastNotification {
  id           String   @id @default(uuid())
  sentById     String
  title        String
  body         String
  audienceJson String   // Ù…Ø¹Ø§ÙŠÙŠØ± Ø§Ù„Ø§Ø³ØªÙ‡Ø¯Ø§Ù (Ø§Ù„ÙƒÙ„/Ø¨Ù„Ø¯/Ù„ØºØ©/Ø¥ØµØ¯Ø§Ø±) ÙƒÙ€ JSON Ù†ØµÙŠ
  recipientsCount Int   @default(0)
  successCount Int      @default(0)
  failureCount Int      @default(0)
  createdAt    DateTime @default(now())
}
